                                       FetchType.EAGER is a JPA standard that defines when data is loaded (immediately).
                                       

                                       @Fetch(FetchMode.JOIN)
                                       is a Hibernate-specific annotation that defines how data is loaded (via an SQL Join).
                                       It automatically forces the relationship to be EAGER, overriding any FetchType.LAZY you have set.


